Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.88,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Por mucho que trabajes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:02.14,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}si te sientes pequeño
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.11,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}vas a seguir pequeño
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.11,0:00:04.12,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Para conseguir lo que quieres
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.12,0:00:05.32,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}tienes que ser la persona
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:05.98,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que ya lo tiene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:06.91,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿Quieres vivir de tu proyecto?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.91,0:00:07.81,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Te sientas y dices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.81,0:00:08.67,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿cómo me voy a sentir
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.67,0:00:10.23,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}bien si tengo 100€
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.23,0:00:11.10,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en la cuenta y estoy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:12.36,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}estresado todo el puto día?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:12.78,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y ahí se queda
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:13.66,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la mayoría de gente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:14.84,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}chocando con lo que ve
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.84,0:00:16.16,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en su realidad hoy mismo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:16.66,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Pero tu vida no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:17.54,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}se crea fuera
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:18.41,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}tu vida se crea dentro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.41,0:00:19.12,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en lo que tú crees
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:19.76,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que mereces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.76,0:00:20.44,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y en lo que crees
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:21.12,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que eres capaz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:22.41,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Pregúntate realmente cómo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.41,0:00:23.95,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}serías y cómo te comportarías
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:24.54,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}si ya vivieras
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:25.07,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de tu sueño
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:26.40,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Estarías mucho más tranquilo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:27.33,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te comportarías de otra
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:27.67,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}manera
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:28.92,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}hablarías de otra manera muy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:29.56,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}distinta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:30.47,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}otra pose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:31.65,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}un gasto de golpe no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.65,0:00:32.99,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te tocaría los cojones tanto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:34.10,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿Pensarías en el siguiente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:35.55,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}proyecto o tendrías un entorno
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.55,0:00:36.67,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que realmente te apoye?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.67,0:00:37.54,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y todo eso lo puedes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:38.98,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}hacer hoy mismo gratis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:40.01,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}con todo lo que piensas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.01,0:00:40.67,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}sobre ti
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:41.81,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}todo lo que sientes sobre
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.81,0:00:42.73,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}ti lo que mereces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.73,0:00:43.14,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}lo que piensas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.14,0:00:43.80,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de la vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:44.43,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y empezarás a ver
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.43,0:00:45.67,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}oportunidades que siempre han
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.67,0:00:46.07,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}estado ahí
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.07,0:00:47.12,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pero nunca las veías
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:48.49,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}porque solo estabas centrado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.49,0:00:49.41,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}en lo que no tenías
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:50.26,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y en lo que te faltaba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.26,0:00:50.69,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Así que empieza hoy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.69,0:00:51.66,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y empieza a actuar como
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.66,0:00:52.90,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}lo haría esa mejor versión
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.90,0:00:53.27,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de ti
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.27,0:00:54.27,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}aunque sea pequeña
